  "body": "Designed with modern family life in mind, this spacious two-level home combines generous proportions, quality finishes and a highly convenient Silverdale location.\r\n\r\nSome of the key features include:\r\n• Four well-proportioned bedrooms across two levels, including a spacious master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and full-sized private ensuite.\r\n• Study Room for additional space, entertainment or work-from-home.\r\n• Stylish bathrooms finished with floor-to-ceiling tiling and contemporary fittings.\r\n• A versatile second living area downstairs, ideal as a media room, family lounge,or additional space for guests.\r\n• Large windows throughout the home bring in excellent natural light and help create a bright, open feel.\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances and a practical layout suited to both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n• Double-glazed windows, air conditioning, digital entry, LED vanity mirrors and other modern features throughout.\r\n• Internal-access single garage with a dedicated laundry area, plus additional off-street parking.\r\n• Zoned for Dairy Flat School and Orewa College.\r\n\r\nThe layout has been thoughtfully designed to offer both privacy and flexibility, making it well suited to families, professionals or those simply wanting extra space.\r\n\r\nPositioned close to Silverdale's shops, cafés, parks and everyday amenities, the property also offers convenient motorway access and easy connections to the wider Hibiscus Coast and nearby beaches.\r\n\r\nWe also have access to a number of other homes within this development, so several options may be available depending on your requirements.\r\n\r\nCome along to the open home, or get in touch to arrange a private viewing.",
